{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/associations.ts",
    "title": "人工代码—依据关联种子的加载合同",
    "summary": "定义并校验人工维护的代码关联文件，使同步层能从明确 locator 构造关系，同时阻止语义相似结果自动升级为 confirmed。",
    "category": "configuration",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "purpose",
        "title": "关系来源与数据模型",
        "body": "该模块把 `docs/repo-review/associations.json` 定义为代码与需求、决策、研究、测试依据之间的人工种子来源。每条记录以仓库相对 codePath 和 symbol 定位代码，以 intent、各类 refs、状态及 evidence 描述关系。相似词命中若未写入种子，不得成为 confirmed，因而这里提供的是可审计输入，而非自动语义匹配器。[[c1]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "loading",
        "title": "加载与最小校验",
        "body": "文件不存在时返回空数组，适配新检出或自带 fixture 的环境；JSON 解析失败、缺少 associations 数组，或条目缺 codePath/symbol 字符串时则抛错，避免损坏配置静默清空已有关系。可选数组和文本会回退为空值；状态仅保留 candidate、missing，其他值统一规范为 confirmed。此处只是最小形状校验，并未验证路径、symbol 或引用锚点真实存在。[[c2]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "refs",
        "title": "引用定位边界",
        "body": "引用允许 `path::anchor` 形式；`parseRef` 只按第一个双冒号拆分，未包含分隔符时 anchor 为 null。它不负责搜索材料或判定锚点唯一性，解析后的定位是否能映射到固定片段应由后续同步层处理。材料中没有后续构边实现，因此只能确认该模块输出种子，不能据此断言 unresolved locator 如何持久化。[[c3]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "人工关联种子的设计约束",
        "reason": "支持种子必须人工维护且相似检索不能自动产生 confirmed 关系的论断。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/associations.ts",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 11
        },
        "quote": "/** Human-maintained seed associations between code fragments and the\n * intent / decision / research / test fragments that justify them.\n *\n * This is NOT an automatic semantic matcher: every entry is hand-curated and\n * must cite concrete requirement ids, decision docs, research docs and test\n * cases. The sync step "
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "关联文件加载与规范化",
        "reason": "说明缺失文件、畸形 JSON、必要字段和状态归一化行为。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/associations.ts",
          "startLine": 55,
          "endLine": 89
        },
        "quote": "/** Load and minimally validate the seed associations. Returns an empty list\n * when the file is absent (fresh checkouts / fixtures that supply their own).\n * Throws on malformed JSON so a broken seed never silently drops relations. */\nexport function loadAssociations(repoRoot: string): AssociationSeed[] {\n  const file"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "路径锚点拆分函数",
        "reason": "支持 path::anchor 的具体解析规则及其有限职责。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:apps/server/src/review/associations.ts",
          "startLine": 92,
          "endLine": 100
        },
        "quote": "/** Split \"path::anchor\" into its parts. */\nexport function parseRef(ref: AssociationRef): {\n  path: string;\n  anchor: string | null;\n} {\n  const idx = ref.indexOf(\"::\");\n  if (idx < 0) return { path: ref, anchor: null };\n  return { path: ref.slice(0, idx), anchor: ref.slice(idx + 2) };\n}"
      }
    ],
    "questions": [
      {
        "question": "关联 locator 解析失败后是否确实保留 rejected 或 missing 历史，而不会覆盖先前有效关系？",
        "why": "本材料只包含种子读取和字符串拆分，没有提供同步、解析及关系 upsert 的源代码，无法确认失败持久化语义。",
        "nextStep": "检查消费 `loadAssociations` 的同步实现及其测试，验证路径、symbol、anchor 不可解析时的状态和旧记录保留策略。",
        "blocking": false,
        "citationKeys": [
          "c1",
          "c3"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
